Android: build the Burst Limit Recompiled v7.3 sources

Guards Windows-only and PC-only code (keyboard glyphs, lobby early connect,
latency probe, Xbox LIVE sign-in, waitable timers) and gives the frame timer a
POSIX clock and sleep, keeping v7.3's GPU-wait sleep.

